{"version":1,"content":"<p>AI算力發展越來越快，背後的用電需求也在不斷增長。在11月6日國家發展改革委舉行的新聞發佈會上，國家能源局發展規劃司副司長葛炬介紹，「十五五」時期，隨着算力等新興產業快速發展，我國用電需求還將持續增長。<strong>預計未來幾年，我國每年新增用電量將達到6000億度左右，相當於每年新增3個上海市的用電量。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585482.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.606457+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T12:29:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"6ff58bf687bc4818d4d9384680ecb5b3baf89063abc090046f3c02997e404151","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}